/github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-2500026119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":2500026119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VA18H","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T08:52:41Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T12:06:01Z","body":"Just fixed the white contact line.\r\nBackface culling logic was rejecting all hits on the first marching iteration, hence the missed reflections close to contact areas.\r\nThis is not the case anymore now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500026119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500197289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-2500197289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":2500197289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VBfup","user":{"login":"RPicster","id":