"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3164851320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3164851320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68o8x4","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T16:06:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T16:06:13Z","body":"I just ran the test scene that has the issue and it's simply the depth tolerance being too low (lower then Godot's default even), and increasing the depth tolerance to Godot's Default resolves the problem\r\n\r\nthis PR test depth of the scene provided (0.1)\r\n<img width=\"1143\" height=\"667\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/445cdb40-9105-4a73-8de7-e6fb19cf6cab\" />\r\n\r\nthis PR test depth set to Godot Default (0.2)\r\n<img width=\"1142\" height=\"669\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcda2e49-436d-41c8-b7b4-e024540762eb\" />\r\n\r\n4.4 stable test depth of the scene provided (0.1)\r\n<img width=\"1149\" height=\"691\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2fe1c6c-2094-4e09-a845-6431e5e9a606\" />\r\n\r\n4.4 stable test depth set to Godot Default (0.2)\r\n<img width=\"1149\" height=\"691\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c56d050-4688-4b8c-a9a6-15216c6d1c16\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164851320/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164891294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3164891294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3164891294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68pGie","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T16:16:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T16:16:29Z","body":"One Side effect of the PR I've noticed, under a sharper angle with godot default tolerance these stripes appear and disappear as you move away or to the cubes, which doesn't happen without the PR unless the tolerance is set to 0, when it only SLIGHTLY happens, with much smaller stripes and much less frequently\r\n\r\n<img width=\"708\" height=\"665\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e0b3a6f-8d05-408b-92b7-f3fb88fda08d\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164891294/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166627643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3166627643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3166627643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68vuc7","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T05:31:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T11:39:37Z","body":"> under a sharper angle with godot default tolerance these stripes appear and disappear as you move away or to the cubes\n\nThis is due to the tolerance being interpreted in view space with this PR (vs in NDC space without) to unlock performance optimization opportunities. Marching away from the camera makes tolerance shrink in NDC space (objects are considered thinner) hence the artifacts.\n\nOne solution could be to bake the downsampled depth buffer in homogeneous view space (concretely adding a W channel to the existing Z) at the cost of more VRAM usage. But this would allow reintroducing the NDC-space tolerance without performance hit, solving both this and the aforementioned \"new default\" issue.\n\nAny views welcome.\n\nAlso it would be good to have this PR tested on real projects to figure out whether these stripping  artefacts are really occurring in a noticeable manner.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166627643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167619451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3167619451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3167619451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68zgl7","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T11:53:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T11:53:40Z","body":"After some extensive testing in my projects it does occasionally become VERY noticeable, but more often I haven't really been able to casually spot the issue.. really it depends on how extensively they're (SSR) used and how much the content is prone to regular SSR artifacts disocclusion artifacts or not, which is likely why I at first didn't notice the issue as I was running in my projects and not such simple environments.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167619451/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191119079","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3191119079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3191119079,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-NJzn","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T09:46:06Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T10:08:36Z","body":"I found a way to iron out most of the stripes and cracks mentioned above.\r\nThis is leveraging a normal check at each marching step to fill in holes when they're happening on the same surface than the step before.\r\n\r\nIt comes with a cost of 1 image read at each step. However bottom line should still be a net performance improvement although less that the ~20% cut initially announced. Will do the benchmarks again when I find some time.\r\n\r\nTest scene : [ssr-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21792417/ssr-test.zip)\r\n\r\nScreenshots taken with 0.2 Tolerance (default) and 512 marching steps.\r\n\r\n| This PR | Master |\r\n|----|----|\r\n| <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-23-34\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/239acc58-f8ad-41ca-8008-4683fa43797c\" /> | <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-25-58\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3d69a2e-c0b7-4897-ac3b-64d1ffdf5d6e\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-23-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6485a98a-efff-47d0-82b0-643c236bebee\" /> | <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-26-09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45831132-3966-45d4-86ad-f245d86e8781\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-24-09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c6d9e1a-dc65-4d14-a678-62c6eac1d149\" /> | <img width=\"837\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-08-15 11-26-23\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec348899-c68b-49bd-a9ce-c55efadc9f53\" /> |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191119079/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":6,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366290546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99693#issuecomment-3366290546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99693","id":3366290546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IpYRy","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T16:03:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T16:13:58Z","body":"Potentially superseded by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111210? (seems to overhaul the whole thing)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is